; A windtrap suite over Windtrap_runtime.Verdicts: the verdict lattice, the
; collection, the file format and its rejections, the deterministic
; output filenames, and the atomic write - the last also end to end
; through a child executable that stands in for a mutation run's writing
; side. The runtime suite next door (test/mutate) covers what stayed in
; Windtrap_runtime.Mutate: identifiers, the registry, arming. Nothing here
; writes under _build/_mutants: every path the suite writes to lives in
; a private scratch directory removed at exit.

(executable
 (name save_child)
 (modules save_child)
 (libraries windtrap windtrap_runtime))

(test
 (name test_mutate_verdicts)
 (modules test_mutate_verdicts)
 (libraries windtrap windtrap_runtime unix)
 (deps save_child.exe))
